OL,3,A'It could cost me #10k but I need the
OL,4,Amoney now': Why Gen Z are opting out of
OL,5,Apensions
OL,6,
OL,7,FUntil early September, Hassan Nassar,
OL,8,F26, was saving around #430 every month
OL,9,Finto his NHS workplace pension.
OL,11,FBut the trainee GP, who works in the
OL,12,FWest Midlands, says he was "really cash
OL,13,Fstrapped" and decided to stop putting
OL,14,Fmoney aside for around "six to 12
OL,15,Fmonths".
OL,17,FHe needs the money to help take care of
OL,18,Fa sick family member, save for his
OL,19,Ffirst home and cover rent and student
OL,20,Floan repayments.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,117,105,200,300,0,100
