OL,3,A'It could cost me #10k but I need the
OL,4,Amoney now': Why Gen Z are opting out of
OL,5,Apensions
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut he's aware there is a cost to
OL,8,Fopting out, estimating he could lose
OL,9,Fbetween "#5,000 and #10,000" in future
OL,10,Fretirement income due to the decades of
OL,11,Fcompound interest he will miss out on
OL,12,Fby not saving now.
